// Knox County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-10
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Pages that block automated fetching (the Auditor's Beacon
// search, the mental health board, United Way and the Board of Elections) were
// checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The county now links the Board of Elections at boe.knoxcounty.oh.gov, which
//     redirects to boe.ohio.gov/knox (the address listed).
//   * Mount Vernon City Schools' old mvcsd.us address redirects to
//     mt-vernon.k12.oh.us.
//   * United Way of Knox County's site (uwayknox.org) now runs on a donor platform
//     and only renders in a browser.
//   * The Auditor's property search is still Beacon (Schneider Geospatial).
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Knox County TN (Knoxville), IN, IL, KY, ME, MO, NE, TX; "MHA of Knox County" on
//   mhanational.org is Vincennes, Indiana; Mount Vernon NY/WA/VA/IL; Danville VA/IL/
//   KY; Fredericktown MO/PA; Utica is in Licking County; Clear Fork Valley Local is
//   Richland County; the old knoxswcd.org domain has expired.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Mount Vernon, the seat). Villages with sites: Centerburg, Danville,
//     Fredericktown and Gambier; Martinsburg and Gann have none.
//   * Five school districts (Mount Vernon City, Fredericktown, Danville, Centerburg,
//     East Knox), the Knox County ESC and Career Center; Kenyon College (Gambier),
//     Mount Vernon Nazarene University and COTC's Knox Campus.
//   * Mental health is the Licking-Knox board (Newark); Knox Public Health also runs
//     the county's FQHC; community action is Kno-Ho-Co-Ashland.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * Utica (its own site places it in Licking County).
//   * The Knox Metropolitan Housing Authority, Coroner, senior centers, Head Start,
//     NAMI and Centerburg festivals: no website or Facebook only.
//   * Vendor portals: Recorder records search, CourtView, sheriff sales.

